<title>POLAND: PETROBANK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.81 vs    1.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.96 vs    1.03</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.71 vs    0.81 loss</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.45 vs    5.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
